  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1313.17 Reflective Markings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1313.17 Reflective Markings.\n\n(a) This section shall not apply to any school bus that has previously been granted a waiver for the use of reflective markings by the commissioner, as a result of a pilot program.\n\n(b) Reflective markings may be used on a school bus as long as the markings meet the requirements set forth in the “National School Transportation Specifications & Procedures”, 2015 edition, available as provided in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1312.18); amd by #8723, eff 9-8-06; ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
